  "description": "Our Blacktop 2.0 pairs the latest mid-drive eBike technology to a high performance city commuter at an affordable price point, with a fully integrated downtube battery and a powerful mid-drive motor. Add an optional city pack for mudguards and rear rack.\nOur all-new mid-drive Blacktop 2.0 city commuter packs in some of the very latest eBike technologies such as a fully integrated and detachable LG 11AH battery to provide an extended range upto 60KM. The handlebar mounted LCD information display shows usual information such as battery level, speed, trip distance and more. It also allows you to choose your assistance level, with 5 levels to choose from. With Shimano 9 speed Acera / Altus gearing and Tektro eBike specific hydraulic disc brakes, the Blacktop 2.0 commuter eBike is the best way to get to work or cruise the city in style and comfort effortlessly.",
